      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LEONARD WILSON KEENAN ESTATE & LETTING AGENTS\r\nOur business is you....\r\n\r\nMOST UNIQUE EXTRA SPACIOUS 3 BED / 3 BATH ENERGY EFFICIENT NEW\r\nDETACHED FAMILY HOME\r\nICF CONSTRUCTION WITH AMAZING ENERGY RATING\r\nDESIGNED TO TAKE FULL ADVANTAGE OF ITS WESTERLY ORIENTATION\r\nSTUNNING INTERIOR\r\nOPTION TO PURCHASE FULLY FURNISHED\r\nMOST IDYLLIC SETTING\r\nWALKING DISTANCE TO NAAS\r\n\r\nA most captivating home in an idyllic setting....\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Patrick Leonard The Leinster Property Specialists are truly delighted to present this beautiful new home to the Kildare Property Market. The property does not qualify for help to buy.\r\n\r\nThis is an architectural gem which must be viewed to be fully appreciated.\r\n\r\nThe extra spacious floor plan consists of: Entrance hallway, living room, kitchen / dining / family room, utility room and downstairs bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe first floor consists of a landing, primary bedroom with en suite bathroom, 2 further bedrooms and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe many features of this stunning home include: Quality flooring throughout, contemporary fitted kitchen with an abundance of base and eye level storage to include all integrated appliances, quality sanitary ware and tiling in all bathrooms, upvc double glazed windows, air to water heating system & floored attic.\r\n\r\nOutside the property has a large double driveway to the front leading to extra wide side entrance. To the rear is a west facing garden with block built boundary walls and feature terrace.\r\n\r\nThe property also falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools making it a real winner with families.\r\n\r\nThis is country living at its best, with a bustling town on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nThe area is serviced by an excellent bus route.\r\n\r\nThe M7 Motorway is close by connecting all surrounding areas and Dublin is within a leisurely commute. \r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
